    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Beneath The Surface&quot; is a terrifying first-person survival horror experience that combines psychological tension, immersive exploration, intense combat, and spine-chilling encounters. Dive into the depths of a foreboding forest, uncover dark secrets, and fight for survival as you descend into a hellish underground world.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377360/extras/de179fd5779f998144fb28cb038bb0bf.poster.avif?t=1735483022\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377360/extras/de179fd5779f998144fb28cb038bb0bf.webm?t=1735483022\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377360/extras/de179fd5779f998144fb28cb038bb0bf.mp4?t=1735483022\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter a world where light reveals hope, but darkness hides unspeakable horrors. With exploration, puzzles, and shooter mechanics, <strong>&quot;Beneath The Surface&quot;</strong> will push your courage and sanity to their limits. Will you escape, or will the nightmare consume you?<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377360/extras/ba8e0ac45086080295a3a4cc875461bb.poster.avif?t=1735483022\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377360/extras/ba8e0ac45086080295a3a4cc875461bb.webm?t=1735483022\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377360/extras/ba8e0ac45086080295a3a4cc875461bb.mp4?t=1735483022\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Begin the search! Expect\u00a0A dark, linear horror experience with <strong>30\u201340 minutes of gripping gameplay</strong>.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377360/extras/5980597a19f25f6e99216e446d7971c4.poster.avif?t=1735483022\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377360/extras/5980597a19f25f6e99216e446d7971c4.webm?t=1735483022\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377360/extras/5980597a19f25f6e99216e446d7971c4.mp4?t=1735483022\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
